**Summary of changes:**
- Added a `TYPE_HINT` mode to highlight type hints in function signatures and after `->`.
- Added a `TYPE_COMMENT` mode to highlight type comments (`# type: ...`).
- Inserted these modes into the appropriate places in the grammar.

This will improve Python type hint highlighting in highlight.js to be more like MagicPython.
